# PROJECT NAME: SKILLORA – RETRO INTERNSHIP MANAGEMENT PORTAL

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a senior frontend developer, software architect and professional UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, responsive and fully interactive Internship Management Portal for my company, **SKILLORA**.

The website will manage the complete internship journey, starting from student registration and ending with project completion, certificate issuance and Letter of Recommendation (LOR).

The website must contain two completely separate interfaces:

1. STUDENT PORTAL
2. ADMIN PORTAL

The entire project must be FRONTEND ONLY.

Do not develop a backend, database, API, Supabase, Firebase or server-side authentication.

Use React state and localStorage to simulate the complete application functionality.

IMPORTANT: Do not create only a landing page or static UI prototype. Build all the pages, navigation, forms, tables, document previews and interactive functionality described below.

